ALL WAFEFREBEORN WORK IS PROVIDED "AS IS," WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND. IN NO EVENT SHALL THE LICENSOR OR ANY WAFEFREBEORN CONTRIBUTORS BE LIABLE FOR ANY CLAIM, DAMAGES OR OTHER LIABILITY, including model outputs, third-party data, privacy failures, deployment in unapproved contexts, use by bad actors, government or corporate misuse, or any consequential, incidental, or punitive damages.

