## 10. Governance and Versioning
This license may be updated over time through a publicly documented governance process. Users may continue under their original version or upgrade to any newer version.

---

## 11. Modifiable License Reserve
Drawing from academic research ("Modifying OSS Licenses", Gagnon et al., 2024), the Licensor reserves the right to modify this license in extreme cases where Waefrebeorn Work causes demonstrable, widespread, irreversible harm that was not anticipated. Modifications apply only to NEW distributions.

