## 12. Provenance
This is v3.0 of the Waefrebeorn Umbrella License, developed in July 2026. The dispensation clause (§5.4) is the formal mechanism for disassociating from malicious users. The modifiable license reserve (§11) provides a research-backed mechanism for responding to emergent harms.

